"Vorg the Sapient" <bdare@optushome.com.au> writes:
> Is there a luck penalty for killing peacefuls under any circumstances?
> That would be a slightly bigger deal than an alignment penalty.

Four cases:

* killing a pet (-1)
* murder (non-chaotic killing a human that began peaceful) (-2)
* killing a co-aligned unicorn (-5)
* killing a peaceful without angering it (50% chance of -1); this last
  is tricky to accomplish, since attacking or zapping a ray at a monster
  will anger it, but it can be done with beam attacks or by a few more
  obscure means.

